{"suttaId":"tha-ap217","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7671,7689],"vripara":"21"},"segments":{"tha-ap217:0.3":"Raṃsisaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap217:1.1":"“Udentaṃ sataraṃsiṃva, pītaraṃsiṃva [sitaraṃsiṃ va (sī. syā.)] bhāṇumaṃ;","tha-ap217:1.3":"Byagghūsabhaṃva pavaraṃ, sujātaṃ pabbatantare.","tha-ap217:2.1":"“Buddhassa ānubhāvo so, jalate pabbatantare;","tha-ap217:2.3":"Raṃse [raṃsyā (?)] cittaṃ pasādetvā, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ.","tha-ap217:3.1":"“Avasesesu kappesu, kusalaṃ caritaṃ mayā;","tha-ap217:3.3":"Tena cittappasādena, buddhānussatiyāpi ca.","tha-ap217:4.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahasseto, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap217:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap217:5.1":"“Sattapaññāsakappamhi, eko āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap217:5.3":"Sujāto nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap217:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap217:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā raṃsisaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap217:8.1":"Raṃsisaññakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
